tile.betteroplenty.turnip.crop.desc=Turnips growing on tilled earth.

# --- Achievements (achievements agent) -----------------------------------------------------
# Ported from BOP 1.2.1 core/BOPAchievements.java. Upstream declares 17 and 8 are reachable in
# this port; the other 9 fire on unported content and are one row each in bop-port-atlas.md 9b,
# with their strings still sitting unused in biomesoplenty.lang.
#
# KEYS ARE RENAMESPACED, STRINGS ARE NOT. Achievement(id, name, ...) builds the lang keys as
# `achievement.<name>` and `achievement.<name>.desc`, and `name` is ours to choose -- so upstream's
# `achievement.bop.achFlower` becomes `achievement.betteroplenty.flower`, matching every other key
# in this file (tile.betteroplenty.*, worldType.betteroplenty.bop). The English is verbatim.
#
# NOTE, for Colin -- BTA and BOP disagree about what a `.desc` is for, and BOP wins here on rule 1.
# Every BTA achievement description is an instruction ("Fly a pig off a cliff.", "Collect every
# color of firefly in a jar."); every BOP one is a joke that does not say how to earn it ("Groovy,
# man."). ScreenAchievements shows `.desc` as the only body text, so a player reads these to find
# out what to do and these will not tell them. Transcribed anyway, because rewriting them is
# rewriting BOP's voice -- but it is a content call, so it is escalated in atlas 9b rather than
# settled here.
achievement.betteroplenty.flower=Flower Child
achievement.betteroplenty.flower.desc=Become one with nature!
achievement.betteroplenty.flower_band=Flower Power
achievement.betteroplenty.flower_band.desc=Groovy, man.
achievement.betteroplenty.dart_blower=Full Auto
achievement.betteroplenty.dart_blower.desc=You'll shoot your eye out, kid!
achievement.betteroplenty.scythe=Plant Killer
achievement.betteroplenty.scythe.desc=The grim reaper's day job.
achievement.betteroplenty.berry=Berry Picking
achievement.betteroplenty.berry.desc=The simple things in life...
achievement.betteroplenty.moss=A Rolling Stone
achievement.betteroplenty.moss.desc=It gathers none of this.
achievement.betteroplenty.thorn=Rather Thorny
achievement.betteroplenty.thorn.desc=Deadlier than cacti!
achievement.betteroplenty.coral=Nutritious
achievement.betteroplenty.coral.desc=How about a big piece of steamed coral?

